# A two platform station where the down platform signal has a subsidiary, so
# that a second train can be called on to the back of the first.

scheme thornley {
    area "Thornley"
    prefix T
}

node W boundary
node E boundary
node J1 plain
node J2 plain

edge P1 from W to J1 length 500 speed 40 direction down
edge P2 from J1 to J2 length 400 speed 25 direction down
edge P3 from J2 to E length 500 speed 40 direction down

section TA over P1
section TB over P2
section TC over P3

signal T1 on P1 at 500 facing forward direction down aspects 3 subsidiary yes
signal T3 on P2 at 400 facing forward direction down aspects 3
